BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chronovisor
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T023000Z
UID:chronovisor-2026-10-05-19:30:00-07:00
DESCRIPTION:While writing a monograph on historical theories of memory\, B
 éatrice (Anne-Laure Sellier)\, a respected academic\, becomes beguiled by
  the allegedly true story of the Chronovisor\, an occult device said to re
 produce visuals from any point in history on a TV screen. Her obsession wi
 th the mysterious machine drags her from her Upper East Side apartment thr
 ough the depths of New York City’s hidden libraries\, to the edge of a b
 reakthrough.\n\n“Don’t miss CHRONOVISOR all hail CHRONOVISOR” — Ja
 ne Schoenbrun (director\, Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma)\n\nJack Au
 en\, Kevin Walker\, United States\, 2026\, 100 min\, in English\, German\,
  Italian\, and French with English subtitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/fi
 lms/chronovisor/\n\nEstimated start: 19:50
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
