BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Once Upon a Time In Seattle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T180500
DTSTAMP:20261102T000000Z
UID:once-upon-time-seattle-2026-11-01-16:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:SPECIAL NOVEMBER 2026 EDITION! ALREADY UPDATED FROM THE SEPTEM
 BER 2026 EDITION! \n\nComprised of moments from over 40 films shot in Seat
 tle\, and a few irresistible facsimiles\, Once Upon a Time in Seattle is p
 art love letter\, part loony action adventure\, and part free-associative 
 meditation on the transience of landscape in a city that has always had a 
 complicated relationship with honoring its past while moving swiftly (reck
 lessly?) into the future.\n\nThere is no linear narrative\, and dialogue i
 s kept to a minimum. The city itself is both location and protagonist\, wh
 ile the function of the human characters\, or perhaps more accurately\, ci
 phers\, is that of a vessel to move us through the city and occasionally o
 ffer loose context or comic relief. With one exception\, no single existin
 g shot or sequence is sustained longer than a minute\, with most individua
 l shots lasting less than 20 seconds\, and over half clocking in at 5 seco
 nds or less. The result is a deceptively complex amalgamation of wholly un
 related material\, and an impressively unique editorial/directorial achiev
 ement.\n\nSurprisingly weaving numerous throughlines from the many dispara
 te existing narratives\, while leaving much open to the viewer’s interpr
 etation\, scene chronology floats between seemingly non sequitur\, to surp
 risingly\, quietly poignant\, depending on the viewer’s own history with
  the city. A hyper-local\, one-of-a-kind film experience and an opportunit
 y to examine Seattle’s ever-changing landscape as seen through the camer
 a lens\, Once Upon a Time in Seattle offers a unique portal to examine our
  city’s topography (and vibe!) of the past\, both near and distant.\n\nC
 ollide-O-Scope\, 2026\, United States\, 101 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nw
 filmforum.org/films/once-upon-time-seattle/\n\nEstimated start: 16:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
